---
---

<section class="section my-0! py-10 relative z-0 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="container">
    <hgroup class="text-center max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <h2>
        What <span
          class="bg-linear-to-r from-[#0179B4] to-[#88D8FF] bg-clip-text text-transparent"
          >we do</span
        >
      </h2>
      <p>
        We are a hospital operator. We own and run our facilities, we employ the clinicians who work
        in them, and we place some of that workforce with hospitals and health systems abroad.
      </p>
    </hgroup>

    <div class="relative grid gap-10 grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 mt-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto after:absolute after:-top-5 after:-left-10 after:bg-[url('/img/shape/shape2.svg')] after:bg-no-repeat after:w-35.5 after:h-9.25 after:bg-position-[left_top] after:bg-contain after:z-0

	before:absolute before:-bottom-5 before:-right-10 before:bg-[url('/img/shape/shape2-1.svg')] before:bg-no-repeat before:w-35.5 before:h-9.25 before:bg-position-[right_bottom] before:bg-contain before:z-0">
      <article
        class="lg:col-span-2 border-2 border-main-200 rounded-xl p-4 lg:p-10 bg-[linear-gradient(45deg,#F8FDFF,#FFFFFF)] text-black"
      >
        <svg class="icon" width="44" height="44">
          <use xlink:href="#i1"></use>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="text-main-200 mt-3">Hospital and clinic operations</h3>
        <p>
          We own and operate hospitals and clinics in Ghana, Nigeria, Kenya, South Africa, the
          Philippines and Morocco — tertiary referral centres, regional hospitals and community
          facilities. Each is licensed in its own country, staffed by our own clinicians, and run on
          a single governance and clinical standard across the group.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article
        class="border-2 border-main-200 rounded-xl p-4 lg:p-10 bg-[linear-gradient(45deg,#F8FDFF,#FFFFFF)] text-black"
      >
        <svg class="icon" width="44" height="44">
          <use xlink:href="#i2"></use>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="text-main-200 mt-3">Our clinical workforce</h3>
        <p>
          Doctors, nurses, midwives, paramedics and allied health staff employed directly by the
          group and working in our hospitals across Africa and Asia.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article
        class="border-2 border-main-200 rounded-xl p-4 lg:p-10 bg-[linear-gradient(45deg,#F8FDFF,#FFFFFF)] text-black"
      >
        <svg class="icon" width="44" height="44">
          <use xlink:href="#i3"></use>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="text-main-200 mt-3">Secondment to Europe and America</h3>
        <p>
          We second our own clinicians to hospitals and health systems in Europe and America, under
          the same governance and the same standards applied in our facilities.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article
        class="border-2 border-main-200 rounded-xl p-4 lg:p-10 bg-[linear-gradient(45deg,#F8FDFF,#FFFFFF)] text-black"
      >
        <svg class="icon" width="44" height="44">
          <use xlink:href="#i4"></use>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="text-main-200 mt-3">Clinical services</h3>
        <p>
          Emergency and inpatient care, surgery, obstetrics and gynaecology, cardiology, oncology,
          intensive care, dialysis, imaging and rehabilitation — delivered across the group.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article
        class="border-2 border-main-200 rounded-xl p-4 lg:p-10 bg-[linear-gradient(45deg,#F8FDFF,#FFFFFF)] text-black"
      >
        <svg class="icon" width="44" height="44">
          <use xlink:href="#i5"></use>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="text-main-200 mt-3">Credential verification</h3>
        <p>
          Every clinician we employ is verified against their registering body, and every
          MedicSupport-issued credential record can be checked publicly at
          <a href="/verify" class="underline">/verify</a> without an account.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>